      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "May or may not be the case, but one potential cause for this, is temporarily blocking a person. For example, if a friend blocks you (or you them) and then immediately unblocks, in order to reload their avatar or in an attempt to fix some other bug perhaps, then that will also remove you from each others favourites lists.\nCould still be it's own bug, but that's at least one potential cause worth being aware of.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
