      "mergeID": "604bcb09155eb70d8d588cb3",
      "mergedPostDetails": "This has happened at least 2-3 times over the past 2-3 weeks where friends I'm about to invite to my world just randomly disappear from my favorites list, which I discover is because of the game removing them from my friends list, since I have to favorite them again.\nI had wondered how my favorites list had gone from 32/32 people to now 24 over the past few months, and now I know why. The game keeps randomly removing them",
