      "value": "Noticed this was happening and thought I may have accidently unfavorited people. I confirmed it wasn't me when I just re-added someone and next day when update 2020.4.4p3 build 1033 came out I was missing the same and more people from my list. Curious if they are lost during updates or just periodically.\nEdit - Additional information: Lost favorites in all 3 of my lists.",
