      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Further update that this is still happening as of now, and I have refilled and lost favorites no less than 3 times in the past 3 months.  It definitely appears to have a correlation with how frequently the users are online, as friends I have on those lists who essentially never log in haven't budged, but friends who I see regularly keep deleting themselves from the list.  My total favorites are currently at 86/96 despite having maxed it out about 3 weeks ago.",
